{"4670900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Morphed Menagerie", "steam_appid": 4670900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your <strong>tarot card deck</strong> by battling shapeshifters. <strong>Morphed Menagerie</strong><i> </i>is a Narrative Deckbuilder about a community of shapeshifters that disguise themselves as zookeepers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a warlock who takes over the souls of these shapeshifters to gain more magical abilities. Choose to win them over in battle or in friendship. They won't forget the choices you've made. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670900/extras/2ce11f06008985f70f2b3297f5596a4b.avif?t=1781890369\" width=300 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay your cards in a 3-card tarot spread. The past and the future cards affect the present card. Predict your opponent's future actions. Win from your opponent and get them on your side in the next battle. Collect shapeshifting cards after each sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670900/extras/213ca3081588a446eec3ba46b1e80bbb.poster.avif?t=1781890369\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670900/extras/213ca3081588a446eec3ba46b1e80bbb.webm?t=1781890369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670900/extras/213ca3081588a446eec3ba46b1e80bbb.mp4?t=1781890369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670900/extras/4f8db45aee03597a9f1a2a94366757b0.avif?t=1781890369\" width=300 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the zoo! Interact with visitors, shapeshifters, do some fun activities, and practice your tarot deckbuilding skills with guests. If you're lost, the signposts will help you find your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670900/extras/17202c17f88ee7cb3c26e3a5c8422a7c.poster.avif?t=1781890369\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670900/extras/17202c17f88ee7cb3c26e3a5c8422a7c.webm?t=1781890369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670900/extras/17202c17f88ee7cb3c26e3a5c8422a7c.mp4?t=1781890369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670900/extras/2f48b404fec1a64e9a86738dff003cb5.avif?t=1781890369\" width=300 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of the risk of the community turning against you. The way you make use of your new deck has consequences. Be a friend or foe, it's up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670900/extras/bb317a2c4e12004e9b345849983e0bc7.poster.avif?t=1781890369\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670900/extras/bb317a2c4e12004e9b345849983e0bc7.webm?t=1781890369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4670900/extras/bb317a2c4e1